#ROOMS
#701
The Plains Road~
You travel down a narrow road.  The road meanders its way through grassy
plains.  About you, you hear the sound of birds singing, and the sun shines
warmly down upon you.  Bright flowers grow at the edges of the road.  The hum
of bees can be heard as they fly from flower to flower.  To the east is the
Southern Road.
~
